ISO-10303-21;
/* Gp022: EDGE_CURVE SameParameter=.T. but 3D LINE uniform over [0,1] disagrees with degree-2 B-spline pcurve with middle pole at (0.8,0.5): at t=0.5, 3D gives u=0.5 vs pcurve u≈0.64 */
